OL,4,CRussia-bound ship still on fire after  
OL,5,Cattack in Gulf of Finland              
OL,6,GRescue and firefighting efforts are    
OL,7,Gcontinuing for a Russian cargo vessel  
OL,8,Ghit by a drone attack in the eastern   
OL,9,GGulf of Finland, authorities have said.
OL,11,FThe ship - the Sparta II - was bound   
OL,12,Ffor Russia's Baltic exclave            
OL,13,FKaliningrad when it was hit on         
OL,14,FSaturday morning, before drifting into 
OL,15,FFinnish waters. Finnish defence forces 
OL,16,Fsaid Ukraine was likely behind the     
OL,17,Fattack. Kyiv has yet to comment.       
